| Clarity / flow | 7 | Ch47, the knock gives “when and not the where”; ch51, “eleventh / twelfth / thirteenth day” sequence | The mechanics are explained with good physical analogies, but repeated restatement slows some stretches, and the final countdown contains a one-day inconsistency. | High |
